    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "God, the Powerful Judge"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "For the choir director: with stringed instruments. A psalm of Asaph. A song."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "God is known in Judah;",
          "his name is great in Israel."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "His tent is in Salem,",
          "his dwelling place in Zion."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "There he shatters the bow’s flaming arrows,",
          "the shield, the sword, and the weapons of war."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "You are resplendent and majestic",
          "coming down from the mountains of prey."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The brave-hearted have been plundered;",
          "they have slipped into their final sleep.",
          "None of the warriors was able to lift a hand."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "At your rebuke, God of Jacob,",
          "both chariot and horse lay still."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "And you #— #you are to be feared.",
          "When you are angry,",
          "who can stand before you?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "From heaven you pronounced judgment.",
          "The earth feared and grew quiet"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "when God rose up to judge",
          "and to save all the lowly of the earth."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Even human wrath will praise you;",
          "you will clothe yourself",
          "with the wrath that remains. ,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Make and keep your vows",
          "to the Lord your God;",
          "let all who are around him bring tribute",
          "to the awe-inspiring one. ,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He humbles the spirit of leaders;",
          "he is feared by the kings of the earth."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      }
    ]
